{"steam_appid":4665920,"steam_name":"Mad Merchant","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4665920/1339349977/7747318569efce491ae97cdc4b31473c93e33bc8/1781971667/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1781972423","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257362915/17551a6e618f78fbc46ffd7f713a48f26e0c1207/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1781972423","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4665920/b4ae6004ff16cc90c1dd65c90183cf4f68ed6769/ss_b4ae6004ff16cc90c1dd65c90183cf4f68ed6769.1920x1080.jpg?t=1785107924","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4665920/0bf041ccd0b7ee284e4ebe5cd8a74f4c017d13b8/ss_0bf041ccd0b7ee284e4ebe5cd8a74f4c017d13b8.1920x1080.jpg?t=1785107924","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4665920/b13faf8fa9f75ad0dcae56fec3b8fdbefee94019/ss_b13faf8fa9f75ad0dcae56fec3b8fdbefee94019.1920x1080.jpg?t=1785107924","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4665920/46e5b16d446886b188a6041103d58f5dddb1c014/ss_46e5b16d446886b188a6041103d58f5dddb1c014.1920x1080.jpg?t=1785107924","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4665920/0257af32f9a27ac35ce38e3691e0667e5fec87e0/ss_0257af32f9a27ac35ce38e3691e0667e5fec87e0.1920x1080.jpg?t=1785107924"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4665920/extras/5cdde2043e98f74c6d5d210839c9742e.avif?t=1785107924\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4665920/extras_big/5cdde2043e98f74c6d5d210839c9742e.webp?t=1785107924 width=1560 height=311 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4665920/extras/3853dd419c9b9d597840425851283a9c.poster.avif?t=1785107924\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4665920/extras/3853dd419c9b9d597840425851283a9c.webm?t=1785107924\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4665920/extras/3853dd419c9b9d597840425851283a9c.mp4?t=1785107924\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The dystopian wastelands are unforgiving. Monitor the status of your wagons in real-time throughout your journey, as each serves a distinct and vital purpose. Prevent system failures and <strong>keep the gears turning</strong>, this rolling empire is your only ticket to survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4665920/extras/605f88e84380a34b54907c71da1b9551.avif?t=1785107924\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4665920/extras_big/605f88e84380a34b54907c71da1b9551.webp?t=1785107924 width=1560 height=311 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4665920/extras/ae0cc8b1dbf3a568c32e2a080e49dab3.poster.avif?t=1785107924\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4665920/extras/ae0cc8b1dbf3a568c32e2a080e49dab3.webm?t=1785107924\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4665920/extras/ae0cc8b1dbf3a568c32e2a080e49dab3.mp4?t=1785107924\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Defend your train against the looming threat of rogue drones. Let your advanced turret system automatically hunt down enemies while you focus on strategy... Or <strong>take direct control</strong> and enjoy blasting targets to pieces with your own hands!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4665920/extras/2f4a11b9b9943f8e983f2c4bb19fed8e.avif?t=1785107924\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4665920/extras_big/2f4a11b9b9943f8e983f2c4bb19fed8e.webp?t=1785107924 width=1560 height=311 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4665920/extras/60db5f9e542ab1c69a2841a931eafb74.poster.avif?t=1785107924\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4665920/extras/60db5f9e542ab1c69a2841a931eafb74.webm?t=1785107924\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4665920/extras/60db5f9e542ab1c69a2841a931eafb74.mp4?t=1785107924\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Haggle with merchants once you reach safe havens. Buy and sell vital mechanical parts for profit, and use your earnings to upgrade your train for the ruthless cross-border journeys ahead. The right upgrade is the fine line between <strong>life and death</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4665920/extras/f1dbe5292fddae801a0240c6199c8115.avif?t=1785107924\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4665920/extras_big/f1dbe5292fddae801a0240c6199c8115.webp?t=1785107924 width=1560 height=311 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4665920/extras/36b0b2571f8b809a4c13a96d0fe1631d.poster.avif?t=1785107924\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4665920/extras/36b0b2571f8b809a4c13a96d0fe1631d.webm?t=1785107924\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4665920/extras/36b0b2571f8b809a4c13a96d0fe1631d.mp4?t=1785107924\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">How you reach the next stop is entirely up to you. Take dangerous shortcuts to save precious time, or opt for safer but agonizingly long routes. Every choice in the wasteland comes with a price. Are you ready to pay it?</p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-8400 / AMD Ryzen 5 2600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1060 6 GB / AMD Radeon RX 580 8 GB<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-12400F / AMD Ryzen 5 5600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3060 12 GB / AMD Radeon RX 6700 XT<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>","genres":["Action","Adventure","Indie","Simulation","Strategy"],"developers":["Ravenholm Interactive"],"publishers":["Stay2Busy"],"release_date":"Jul 20, 2026"}